docs {
  ## Revoke API Client
  
  Bruno: `admin/Revoke API Client`
  
  Sets `active: false` on the client — its `apiKey`/`apiSecret` immediately stop working for
  every other endpoint (`ApiClientServiceImpl.validateCredentials` checks `active` before
  checking the secret). There's no un-revoke; issue a new client instead.
  
  Code source: `ApiClientControllerImpl.revokeApiClient` / `ApiClientServiceImpl.revokeApiClient`.
}
